{"s":48,"v":[{"t":"Indeed, We have given you, [O Muḥammad], a clear conquest","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["فَتَحْنَا","We have given victory","fataḥnā","",[["فَتَحْ",597],["نَا",11]]],["لَكَ","to you","laka","",[["لَ",8],["كَ",18]]],["فَتْحًۭا","a victory","fatḥan",""],["مُّبِينًۭا","clear","mubīnan",""]]},{"t":"That Allāh may forgive for you what preceded of your sin [i.e., errors] and what will follow and complete His favor upon you and guide you to a straight path","w":[["لِّيَغْفِرَ","That may forgive","liyaghfira","",[["لِّ",8],["يَغْفِرَ",192]]],["لَكَ","for you","laka","",[["لَ",8],["كَ",18]]],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["تَقَدَّمَ","preceded","taqaddama",""],["مِن","of","min",""],["ذَنۢبِكَ","your sins","dhanbika","",[["ذَنۢبِ",326],["كَ",18]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["تَأَخَّرَ","will follow","ta-akhara",""],["وَيُتِمَّ","and complete","wayutimma","",[["وَ",1],["يُتِمَّ",584]]],["نِعْمَتَهُۥ","His favor","niʿ'matahu","",[["نِعْمَتَ",247],["هُۥ",5]]],["عَلَيْكَ","upon you","ʿalayka","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["كَ",18]]],["وَيَهْدِيَكَ","and guide you","wayahdiyaka","",[["وَ",1],["يَهْدِيَ",96],["كَ",18]]],["صِرَٰطًۭا","(to) a Path","ṣirāṭan",""],["مُّسْتَقِيمًۭا","Straight","mus'taqīman",""]]},{"t":"And [that] Allāh may aid you with a mighty victory.","w":[["وَيَنصُرَكَ","And Allah may help you","wayanṣuraka","",[["وَ",1],["يَنصُرَ",209],["كَ",18]]],["ٱللَّهُ","And Allah may help you","l-lahu",""],["نَصْرًا","(with) a help","naṣran",""],["عَزِيزًا","mighty","ʿazīzan",""]]},{"t":"It is He who sent down tranquility into the hearts of the believers that they would increase in faith along with their [present] faith. And to Allāh belong the soldiers of the heavens and the earth, and ever is Allāh Knowing and Wise.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِىٓ","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["أَنزَلَ","sent down","anzala",""],["ٱلسَّكِينَةَ","[the] tranquility","l-sakīnata","",[["ٱل",2