]]},{"t":"Indeed, those who pledge allegiance to you, [O Muḥammad] - they are actually pledging allegiance to Allāh. The hand of Allāh is over their hands. So he who breaks his word only breaks it to the detriment of himself. And he who fulfills that which he has promised Allāh - He will give him a great reward.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["يُبَايِعُونَكَ","pledge allegiance to you","yubāyiʿūnaka","",[["يُبَايِعُ",1142],["ونَ",3],["كَ",18]]],["إِنَّمَا","only","innamā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["مَا",0]]],["يُبَايِعُونَ","they pledge allegiance","yubāyiʿūna","",[["يُبَايِعُ",1142],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱللَّهَ","(to) Allah","l-laha",""],["يَدُ","(The) Hand","yadu",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَوْقَ","(is) over","fawqa",""],["أَيْدِيهِمْ","their hands","aydīhim","ۚ",[["أَيْدِي",116],["هِمْ",3]]],["فَمَن","Then whoever","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَن",25]]],["نَّكَثَ","breaks (his oath)","nakatha",""],["فَإِنَّمَا","then only","fa-innamā","",[["فَ",7],["إِنَّ",15],["مَا",0]]],["يَنكُثُ","he breaks","yankuthu",""],["عَلَىٰ","against","ʿalā",""],["نَفْسِهِۦ","himself","nafsihi","ۖ",[["نَفْسِ",51],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَمَنْ","and whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَنْ",25]]],["أَوْفَىٰ","fulfils","awfā",""],["بِمَا","what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["عَـٰهَدَ","he has covenanted","ʿāhada",""],["عَلَيْهُ","(with)","ʿalayhu","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هُ",5]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["فَسَيُؤْتِيهِ","soon He will give him","fasayu'tīhi","",[["فَ",7],["سَ",118],["يُؤْتِي",59],["هِ",5]]],["أَجْرًا","a reward","ajran",""],["عَظِيمًۭا","great","ʿaẓīman",""]]},{"t":"Those who remained behind of the bedouins will say to you, \"Our properties and our families occupied us, so ask forgiveness for us.\" They say with their tongues what is not within their hearts. Say, \"Then who could prevent Allāh at all if He intended for you harm or intended for you benefit? Rather, ever is Allāh, of what you do, Aware.","w":[["سَيَقُولُ","Will say","